Concept used:

Follow the BODMAS rule as given in the below table:

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/1a057cc6d6b8e0895a55add7f4d97e07109a6601a719772fca9f5e02d4ab95e4.png] 

Calculation:

⇒ 6 × 7 - {9 ÷ 3 + [3 × (5 - 2)]}

⇒ 6 × 7 - {9 ÷ 3 + [3 × 3]}

⇒ 6 × 7 - {9 ÷ 3 + [9]}

⇒ 6 × 7 - {3 + 9}

⇒ 42 - 12

⇒ 30

TheThw answer is 30.
